      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "🚨WANTED MAN IN CUSTODY!  Tampa Marine Unit, with support from the Jacksonville Air and Marine Branch and U.S. Coast Guard Sector St. Petersburg, conducted an at-sea boarding of a U.S.-flagged freighter for a wanted subject in the Gulf of America. The team served an active warrant for a United States citizen crew member wanted on multiple Felony charges of Child Sexual Abuse materials. The subject was apprehended without incident, and taken into custody. The subject was transferred to Hillsborough County Sheriff’s Office and Tampa HSI agents. #UnderArrest",
      "text_resolved": "🚨WANTED MAN IN CUSTODY!  Tampa Marine Unit, with support from the Jacksonville Air and Marine Branch and U.S. Coast Guard Sector St. Petersburg, conducted an at-sea boarding of a U.S.-flagged freighter for a wanted subject in the Gulf of America. The team served an active warrant for a United States citizen crew member wanted on multiple Felony charges of Child Sexual Abuse materials. The subject was apprehended without incident, and taken into custody. The subject was transferred to Hillsborough County Sheriff’s Office and Tampa HSI agents. #UnderArrest",
